<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f5f0ea; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08);">
    <div style="background: #334155; padding: 24px; text-align: center;">
      <h1 style="color: white; margin: 0; font-size: 20px;">Ren0vate Support</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="padding: 28px;">
      <p style="color: #334155;">Bonjour <strong><%= @user.email %></strong>,</p>
      <p style="color: #475569;">Votre demande de support a bien été reçue et enregistrée sous le numéro :</p>
      <div style="background: #f1f5f9; border-left: 4px solid #334155; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 16px 0;">
        <strong style="font-size: 18px; color: #334155;">Ticket #<%= @ticket.id %></strong><br>
        <span style="color: #64748b;"><%= @ticket.subject %></span>
      </div>
      <p style="color: #475569;">Notre équipe s'engage à vous répondre <strong>dans les 24 heures</strong> (jours ouvrables).</p>
      <div style="margin-top: 24px; text-align: center;">
        <a href="<%= support_ticket_url(@ticket) %>"
           style="background: #334155; color: white; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">
          Suivre ma demande
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="background: #f8fafc; padding: 16px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8;">
      Ren0vate · Support prioritaire 24h · <a href="mailto:robin@primes-services.be" style="color: #334155;">robin@primes-services.be</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
